DESCRIPTION:
      This Java program prompts the user to enter a character and checks if it is a vowel (a, e, i, o, u, and their uppercase counterparts). 
  It uses an if statement with logical OR to determine if the input is a vowel or a consonant. The program then prints the corresponding result ("Vowel" or "Consonant") based on the input.
      

